1) You need MR... Several ways to get it. Reverse genocide gray dragons
is one, if you can get a cursed ?oG. The other way is to go up to a
high level in the dungeon, and sacrifice until you get Magicbane (since
you are neutral).
2) You need to kill a magic resistant Rodney. A wielded cockatrice
corpse is an obvious choice, but not if you need MR from Magicbane.
You might get stuck with poking him with MB from the upstairs.
Conflict could also work.

BEWARE!!!
If a black dragon disintegrates Rodney, the AoY and the Invocation
artifacts will survive, but the PYEC will be destroyed.

Fighting Rodney without MR:
As others have noted, you can protect yourself against the touch of
death with hallucination.  However, that will not protect you from his
"headache" attack, the "destroy armor" attack, or the "curse all your
stuff" attack.  Really it only makes sense if you have a cockatrice
corpse, but remember, he might vaporize your gloves.  There is also the
concept of protecting yourself by not letting Rodney get next to you,
i.e. confused create monster and/or scroll of earth, but that's risky.



